                                "sense_id": "7bbe1478-4196-3f7b-b0ab-3f896e70e972",
                                "text": "A group of anti-Park farmers who tried to drive into the capital on tractors and trucks had skirmishes with police overnight in Suwon, just south of the capital, Seoul."
